  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Smart Grid Roadmap Feasibility Study Phase II, through Boston Consulting Group, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a feasibility study for Power Cell, a Bangladesh government department responsible for power sector reform, to develop implementation plans for smart grid technology deployment at two major utilities in Bangladesh. This feasibility study will help Power Cell implement smart grid infrastructure to reduce the number and duration of power outages and improve grid efficiency and operations in Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
